It began as this repository's src/platform and was moved out on 2026-10-31. The
copy here is the whole upstream tree (src/, include/, README.md, LICENSE,
Makefile); ArmyMen2's own Makefile compiles src/*.cpp directly into the native
and hybrid builds rather than through the library target.

Change it upstream, then copy the tree back here and update this note.
src/glyphs.inc is the one exception in direction: it is generated in this
repository by tools/glyphdump.py from tests/glyphs-reference.txt (glyphs
recorded from the game under Wine), and make check verifies the copy here
against that generator -- carry a regenerated file upstream.
